      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEBLEC POLLY (2) missed the frame last time when fourth (43.79) at Angle Park but prior to that had two placings in a row. Has a good record at this journey. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Better than last start and worth following up. BING BING PERIL (1) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. AKELA MARTIAL (4) was below best last time but the start prior was a Grade 5/6 winner in the quickest time on the card at Gawler over 643m in a Grade 5/6. Solid beginner and with a good start can clear the tricky draw. Can improve sharply here. WHODAT HOOKED (6) is likely to have admirers.",
